      "text": "$7.5 \\mathrm{~N}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a21xb",
      "text": "$12.5 \\mathrm{~N}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PL8J1",
      "text": "$5 \\mathrm{~N}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have given, $y=0.03 \\sin (450 t-9 x)$\r\n\r\nComparing it with standard equation of wave, we get $\\omega=$\r\n\r\n$450 \\mathrm{k}=9$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{v}=\\frac{\\omega}{\\mathrm{k}}=\\frac{450}{9}=50 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$\r\n\r\nVelocity of travelling wave on a stretched string is given by $\\mathrm{v}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{T}}{\\mu}} \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{T}}{\\mu}=2500$\r\n\r\n$\\mu=$ linear mass density $\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{T}=2500 \\times 5 \\times 10^{-3}$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow 12.5 \\mathrm{~N}$",
    "image": null
  },
